Technically, the Nifty 50 has again slipped towards the crucial 22,600 support zone, keeping the short-term structure cautious. Immediate support is placed at 22,530–22,550, followed by 22,360–22,380.
On the upside, 22,800–22,860 remains the key resistance zone, with a sustained breakout required to revive buying momentum. A move above 22,860 could open the way towards 23,000–23,010, while failure to hold 22,530 may bring renewed selling pressure.
